, "title": "employee notice"}], "description": "Students learn why HR data requires special care because it affects employment, identity, health, pay, and workplace power."}, {"id": "b57f4cd7-ee56-4525-971f-47d28da057f4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Security and access controls", "children": [{"id": "76ab08be-88d5-435b-871f-c664bcffebcd", "type": "concept", "title": "role-based access"}, {"id": "da5a9df7-e869-486f-b750-07ab97bac7fa", "type": "concept", "title": "least privilege"}, {"id": "c113b5e1-4d1f-43db-b1e5-b45d22c21a3f", "type": "concept", "title": "audit logs"}, {"id": "96cb4f13-23fa-40b4-a78a-a6b4746b9896", "type": "concept", "title": "encryption"}, {"id": "4f0a44b7-9af8-4b31-86e3-f4afb6d64df3", "type": "concept", "title": "vendor access"}, {"id": "510555fa-624b-4ba8-89dc-c9f06542c171", "type": "concept", "title": "incident response"}], "description": "This subtopic introduces practical controls for preventing unauthorized access, leakage, and misuse of HR data."}, {"id": "92e8548d-9e5d-4b94-abdf-4e6a3b038889", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Responsible AI governance", "children": [{"id": "c06afd50-105c-4dab-b2c5-b3a5564c5363", "type": "concept", "title": "model cards"}, {"id": "34c61741-ad50-4f2c-b313-280f41bdb685", "type": "concept", "title": "bias audits"}, {"id": "0cfad42d-0955-46e6-a805-8cbe215492a1", "type": "concept", "title": "explainability"}, {"id": "a4000bf2-5cfe-4cc5-a467-cb88bd570abb", "type": "concept", "title": "procurement review"}, {"id": "d5e4a5d3-6434-474a-8ba6-0190df2d8e8b", "type": "concept", "title": "human oversight"}, {"id": "2c9ff45d-f817-4723-93dc-62b764767ba9", "type": "concept", "title": "appeals"}], "description": "Students learn to evaluate AI tools for hiring, performance, scheduling, learning, and employee listening."}]}, {"id": "4e063eea-3b13-4f55-b535-ed3880d707b3", "type": "topic", "title": "HR Technology Selection, Implementation, and Change Adoption", "description": "Students learn that HRIS success is not only a software choice; it depends on process design, stakeholder adoption, data migration, and post-launch governance.", "children": [{"id": "3d1f0467-f566-4b5d-a7fd-c23081bbbd0f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Requirements and vendor evaluation", "children": [{"id": "91edef78-4624-42d5-8aa2-c2a044a5ece5", "type": "concept", "title": "requirements gathering"}, {"id": "570ae49d-8753-4969-9ece-78efe0a06f12", "type": "concept", "title": "RFPs"}, {"id": "6fd5d003-9b1f-4cb6-8cbc-b67d82860a65", "type": "concept", "title": "demo scripts"}, {"id": "5bda3db2-8d45-40f7-9d8e-25466d70d79d", "type": "concept", "title": "total cost of ownership"}, {"id": "d3752c86-6ad1-435d-bfc8-09a24f142dc8", "type": "concept", "title": "vendor risk"}, {"id": "f7bd150e-59eb-4db2-a644-7998f30b2760", "type": "concept", "title": "service levels"}], "description": "This subtopic teaches students to translate HR needs into requirements and compare vendor promises with organizational realities."}, {"id": "99ac5bd1-eba2-4481-9ff5-7d5499c5ae6f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Implementation and migration", "children": [{"id": "41349b48-fbf0-406f-93cc-e3dc680fe6f8", "type": "concept", "title": "process redesign"}, {"id": "1fd36c5a-1c53-40bd-b3da-fe913a955fd5", "type": "concept", "title": "configuration"}, {"id": "651edde7-c2cc-4d20-8efc-a68db736bf00", "type": "concept", "title": "data migration"}, {"id": "ff20c73c-259c-409b-b010-be1d0349dc58", "type": "concept", "title": "testing"}, {"id": "f1028b27-8786-4f19-b598-62dfec6ed804", "type": "concept", "title": "cutover planning"}, {"id": "c4ed7f56-635c-430e-8714-100c558fd17e", "type": "concept", "title": "training"}], "description": "Students learn the core workstreams involved in moving from old processes and data to a usable new system."}, {"id": "dae7516c-45a2-4128-ae2b-5d8e8ba43b6d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Adoption and continuous improvement", "children": [{"id": "07b4c082-145b-4068-820a-35eef8e3880a", "type": "concept", "title": "stakeholder mapping"}, {"id": "c6ce4421-27f0-4ba8-820a-273aaa253af2", "type": "concept", "title": "communications"}, {"id": "fe3af201-f66d-4b4c-9e5c-db5016a7f445", "type": "concept", "title": "manager enablement"}, {"id": "4431aee8-c5b7-43fd-83eb-9e502be12778", "type": "concept", "title": "user support"}, {"id": "b1bd1c1d-b5a4-4edc-91fe-d24db90fde9d", "type": "concept", "title": "post-launch metrics"}], "description": "The course emphasizes change management, employee experience, analytics adoption, and iterative improvement."}]}, {"id": "f8ac78f9-248c-49fd-955c-77699af740b1", "type": "topic", "title": "People Analytics Capstone and Portfolio Project", "description": "The capstone requires students to demonstrate the full workflow: define a workforce problem, prepare data, analyze patterns, address ethics, and present a decision-ready recommendation.", "children": [{"id": "64ae9ce6-7738-4a43-9c11-f42b2d61418f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Problem framing and analytic plan", "children": [{"id": "ce8ac385-507e-4844-ad5b-2b530b6a6bdb", "type": "concept", "title": "problem statement"}, {"id": "70d80ad4-b8d3-442f-98bb-6a824b7138af", "type": "concept", "title": "stakeholder map"}, {"id": "209d99da-436f-4700-8dc1-90092bfa05f8", "type": "concept", "title": "success metrics"}, {"id": "3de2bbb6-6ee7-4cd5-ae52-63acfcb20d16", "type": "concept", "title": "data inventory"}, {"id": "5ec82115-8b0d-408e-836b-a461d25c0083", "type": "concept", "title": "risk assessment"}], "description": "Students learn to scope a project so the analysis is answerable, useful, and ethically appropriate."}, {"id": "1ece2753-409d-4a97-8dbe-73f063556637", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Analysis and dashboard build", "children": [{"id": "5a9c7008-df90-4994-a558-d3733bb740b2", "type": "concept", "title": "data cleaning"}, {"id": "2f3905f3-583f-43ab-b597-a9f252a259cc", "type": "concept", "title": "metric calculations"}, {"id": "39802004-6a0a-4b1e-80f1-a110af6a9406", "type": "concept", "title": "segmentation"}, {"id": "488da151-b16a-4482-a021-6ad7ee319297", "type": "concept", "title": "dashboard layout"}, {"id": "8dd93f96-fdbc-4102-8cdb-6f25a8c32520", "type": "concept", "title": "quality checks"}], "description": "Students produce a reproducible analysis with clear assumptions, clean visuals, and documented limitations."}, {"id": "f9300352-5dc5-4c9b-91b2-b3f7a5f5495f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Executive recommendation", "children": [{"id": "b4fc83fc-6206-4528-b7c3-9c49698c599b", "type": "concept", "title": "executive memo"}, {"id": "28c62fa2-e317-44b5-b03d-78a001c97a13", "type": "concept", "title": "storytelling"}, {"id": "db54d78e-be7b-4728-82d1-66a67cb1cf53", "type": "concept", "title": "action plan"}, {"id": "c24d7855-717d-46d9-90e3-f7016c435806", "type": "concept", "title": "ethics note"}, {"id": "54898ebb-e46f-49c5-83be-35a126d63e7d", "type": "concept", "title": "measurement plan"}, {"id": "e2a7e9cc-6caf-4606-8f2d-364316a4a9ac", "type": "concept", "title": "portfolio reflection"}], "description": "The final deliverable turns evidence into a practical HR decision with implementation steps and impact measures."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$hrahjson$::jsonb,
